  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> are square matrices such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2020</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi></math> and <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B,</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to (where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;is a null matrix)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
